msgid "Someone already answered this one. Nothing was done twice."
msgstr "Alguien ya contestó a esta. No se ha hecho nada dos veces."

msgid "That question does not exist in this business."
msgstr "Esa pregunta no existe en este negocio."

msgid "This question is closed: its automation no longer waits for it."
msgstr "Esta pregunta está cerrada: su automatización ya no la espera."

msgid "This question was asked of someone else: you cannot answer it."
msgstr "Esta pregunta se le hizo a otra persona: tú no puedes contestarla."

msgid "Too late: nobody answered it in time, so it was closed. Nothing was done."
msgstr "Demasiado tarde: nadie la contestó a tiempo y se cerró. No se ha hecho nada."

msgid "answer before"
msgstr "contestar antes de"

msgid "answered at"
